You can group fields by using a **Group** component in `FormLayout.json` and listing the component IDs in its `children` array. That makes the fields part of the same group, so you can apply dynamics to the group as a whole instead of configuring each field separately. [2]

Example: [2]

```json
[
  {
    "id": "<unique-id>",
    "type": "Group",
    "children": [
      "field1",
      "field2"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "field1",
    "type": "Input",
    "textResourceBindings": {
      "title": "Field 1"
    },
    "dataModelBindings": {
      "simpleBinding": "field1"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "field2",
    "type": "Input",
    "textResourceBindings": {
      "title": "Field 2"
    },
    "dataModelBindings": {
      "simpleBinding": "field2"
    }
  }
]
```

